      },
      {
        "id": "detail",
        "q": "This authorization has no valid issuing office.",
        "a": "It has my signature. Offices derive their authority from people, Ellis. Do try to remember which people. I have fed this building through five winters.",
        "mood": "uneasy"
      },
      {
        "id": "follow",
        "q": "Will you put the exception for Noll in writing?",
