      },
      {
        "id": "detail",
        "q": "Your apartment field just changed.",
        "a": "That is not a typo. It is an instruction. A-000 means remove from the active population. It has happened to people who were sitting at their desks. Please keep the old entry.",
        "mood": "uneasy"
      },
      {
        "id": "follow",
        "q": "What distinguishes your real carbons?",
        "a": "The letter O. I strike it twice. See the little dark rim? The file says F-008 was a return, not an original admission. It also lists you. The correction will try to erase this conversation next.",
